ow to the skin.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <img class=\"week-line\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0657\/6907\/8877\/files\/Line_5_4cb120d7-d58a-440c-972d-717a0c5f5ee9.png?v=1761559147&width=2048\" alt=\"\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"weeks-center\">\n        <img class=\"product-main\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0657\/6907\/8877\/files\/Rectangle_22_2-pfti.png?width=3840\" alt=\"Product\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"weeks-column right-column\">\n        <div class=\"week-block\">\n            <img class=\"week-line right-line\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0657\/6907\/8877\/files\/Line_5_4cb120d7-d58a-440c-972d-717a0c5f5ee9.png?v=1761559147&width=2048\" alt=\"\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            <div class=\"week-text\">\n                <h3>WEEK 7–8<\/h3>\n                <p>Consistent energy and clearer focus throughout the day; body feels more resilient and balanced.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"week-block\">\n            <img class=\"week-line right-line\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0657\/6907\/8877\/files\/Line_5_4cb120d7-d58a-440c-972d-717a0c5f5ee9.png?v=1761559147&width=2048\" alt=\"\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            <div class=\"week-text\">\n                <h3>WEEK 9–10<\/h3>\n                <p>Greater strength, faster recovery, and visible radiance — skin, mood, and energy in sync.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"week-block\">\n            <img class=\"week-line right-line\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0657\/6907\/8877\/files\/Line_5_4cb120d7-d58a-440c-972d-717a0c5f5ee9.png?v=1761559147&width=2048\" alt=\"\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            <div class=\"week-text\">\n            