alia's leading scientists, using qualitative and quantitive methods, rigorously testing and comparing what was previously the best on the market with an all new, uncompromising Australian-made formula.<\/p>","text_size":100,"button_text":"","button_link":"","button_color":"btn--black","button_style":"btn--solid","button_size":"btn--medium","video_link":"","video_text":""}}},"block_order":["slide_m4HyC6"],"name":"Sticky images and text: Horizontal","settings":{"scroll_direction":"horizontal","text_alignment":"left","image_position":"is-reversed","space_around_images":true,"image_width":"standard","aspect_ratio_desktop":1.5,"aspect_ratio_mobile":1.5,"show_single_text":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-6","width":"wrapper","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"section_accordions_ErkxKy":{"type":"section-accordions","blocks":{"text_pX6VyF":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"How long does it take to see results?","text":"<p>Most users notice improved focus and energy within a few days, with results compounding over the following weeks.<\/p>"}},"text_BakWNe":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Can I take Ultra Performance with other supplements or pre-workouts?","text":"<p>Yes. It can complement most daily wellness routines. If you are taking prescription medication or are under medical supervision, consult your healthcare professional before use.<\/p>"}},"text_gaxe9p":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Is it safe for everyday use?","text":"<p>Ultra Performance is made from high-quality, food-grade ingredients at levels suitable for regular consumption. It contains no synthetic hormones or banned substances.<\/p>"}},"text_eNHWVD":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Who is Ultra Performance for?","text":"<p>Ultra Performance is formulated for women who want to sustain energy, focus, and vitality while supporting an active, balanced lifestyle—whether at work, in training, or managing a busy schedule.<\/p>"}},"text_RW9xPP":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"What makes Ultra Performance for Women different?","text":"<p>Ultra Performance brings together adaptogenic botanicals, vitamins, and collagen peptides in a carefully balanced formulation designed to support energy metabolism, focus, and overall wellbeing as part of an active lifestyle.<\/p>"}},"text_RVBFLW":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"What makes Ultra Performance different from other supplements?","text":"<p>Unlike pills or injectables that target only one area, Ultra Performance is a precision-engineered vitality system. It works on a cellular level to support real biological change - improving testosterone balance, energy, focus, and recovery without synthetic hormones.<\/p>"}},"text_bwkdzp":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Does Ultra Performance contain caffeine or stimulants?","text":"<p>It includes a small amount of natural caffeine from botanical sources such as green coffee and guarana—enough to support alertness and focus without causing jitteriness.<\/p>"}},"text_LhzigJ":{"type":"text","settings":{"title":"Is Ultra Performance a therapeutic or medical product?","text":"<p>No. Ultra Performance is a nutritional supplement formulated with food-grade ingredients designed to support energy, focus, and overall wellbeing as part of a healthy lifestyle. It is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Always read the label and follow the directions for use.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["text_pX6VyF","text_BakWNe","text_gaxe9p","text_eNHWVD","text_RW9xPP","text_RVBFLW","text_bwkdzp","text_LhzigJ"],"name":"Accordions","settings":{"layout":"two-columns","show_accordion_divider":false,"line_thickness":"normal","subheading":"","title":"Frequently Asked Questions","type_style":"font-heading","heading_size":120,"text":"","tabs_bg_color":"#fafafa","color_scheme":"","border_color":"","width":"wrapper","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50}},"section_custom_html_HwzF4g":{"type":"section-custom-html","name":"Custom code","settings":{"custom_code":"<!-- Start of Judge.